ait":"1"},"text":"이제 곧 있으면... 그 이미지도 바니걸으로 바뀔 것입니다!!","texts":{"en":"Very soon... even that image will turn into a bunny girl!!","ja":"もうまもなく…そのイメージもバニーガールに変わるはずです！！","zh-Hans":"马上……那个幻象也会变成兔女郎的！！","zh-Hant":"再過不久……那個畫面也會變成兔女郎的！！","th":"อีกไม่นาน... มโนภาพนั้นก็จะเปลี่ยนเป็นบันนี่เกิร์ลด้วยค่ะ!!","es":"¡Y muy pronto... esa imagen también cambiará a una chica conejita!"},"author":"bunnygloria"},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":54,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_faction_001","FadeInDuration":"1","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1"}},{"class":"Spawn","line":56,"fields":{"Path":"ShakePrinter","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":57,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Drum_03","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":58,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"아니, 왜 그렇게 바니걸에 진심이냐고!!","texts":{"en":"No, why are you so dead serious about bunny girls?!","ja":"いや、何でそんなにバニーガールに全力なんだよ！！","zh-Hans":"不是，为什么你对兔女郎执念这么深啊！！","zh-Hant":"不是，妳到底為什麼對兔女郎執著成這樣啦！！","th":"ไม่สิ ทำไมต้องจริงจังกับบันนี่เกิร์ลขนาดนั้นด้วยเล่า!!","es":"Oye, ¡¿por qué te tomas tan en serio a las chicas conejita?!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"PrintText","line":59,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그만 좀 쓰러져!!","texts":{"en":"Just stay down already!!","ja":"いい加減倒れてくれ！！","zh-Hans":"快给我乖乖倒下吧！！","zh-Hant":"妳快點給我乖乖倒下啦！！","th":"ล้มพับไปสักทีสิ!!","es":"¡¡Cáete de una vez!!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"StopBgm","line":61,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"2","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":62,"fields":{}},{"class":"HideAllActors","line":63,"fields":{"Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"DestroyAllSpawned","line":64,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":65,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1.5"}},{"class":"Skip","line":67,"fields":{"Enable":"false"}},{"class":"End","line":69,"fields":{"Fade":"1"}}]}